<BaseLayout title="About ShipMargin" description="Why ShipMargin exists and what the free shipping tools are designed to do." canonicalPath="/about/">
  <header class="tool-hero"><span class="eyebrow">About the project</span><h1>Shipping math should lead to a decision.</h1><p>ShipMargin turns package measurements into plain-language cost and margin signals for sellers everywhere.</p></header>
  <article class="content-section"><h2>Why we built it</h2><p>Many calculators stop at a formula. ShipMargin keeps scale weight, dimensional weight, billable weight, package volume and margin together so a seller can decide whether to change the carton, price or shipping charge.</p><h2>What it is not</h2><p>ShipMargin is independent planning software. It is not a carrier, accounting system, postage quote or substitute for a current carrier agreement.</p><h2>Free first</h2><p>The launch product is free and does not require registration. Future paid features will only be considered if users repeatedly need saved catalogues, larger workflows, integrations or team reporting.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
